# Unreal generated files (project may live in a subdirectory).
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/DerivedDataCache/

# IDE and build-system output. Keep .vsconfig for shared toolchain requirements.
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln.docstates
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
*.code-workspace

# Local engine checkouts, packaged builds and raw profiling captures.
/Engine/
/Builds/
/Artifacts/
*.utrace
*.ucache
*.nvprof

# Local environment and OS files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Intentionally tracked: Config, Content, Source, Plugins source, Build metadata,
# .uproject, .uplugin, .vsconfig, World Partition external actor/object assets.
# Do not broadly ignore Build/: icons and platform build configuration belong in Git.
# Binary-only third-party plugins require an explicit, reviewed exception to Binaries/.
